      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Conversion Reference\n\n- **1 WSFU = 1 GPM = 3.79 liter/min**\n- **1 in = 25.4 mm**\n\n## Important Notes\n\nThis conversion is only true for one or a few fixtures. Since all fixtures in a system are never used at the same time, the total units achieved by adding the numbers for all fixtures must be compensated for their intermittent use.\n\nFor supply pipe lines, this is taken care of in the sizing tables. For manifolds or special equipment sizing, a formula or table can be used to account for intermittent fixture usage."
